{"title":"Virikh Lord","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 56 Skeleton that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/grave-rivet\">Grave Rivet</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-lord\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-lord?lv=56\">Lv 56 <span>299</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-lord?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>66</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/virikh-lord?lv=56\" title=\"Pick level 56\"><td><b>56</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>389</td><td>35.3</td><td>2,800</td><td class=\"muted\">1,167 · 49.4 · 8,400</td><td>299</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/virikh-lord?lv=59\" title=\"Pick level 59\"><td><b>59</b></td><td>440</td><td>37</td><td>2,950</td><td class=\"muted\">1,320 · 51.8 · 8,850</td><td>66</td><td>in the wilds around 2028, 276</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 2 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 2 looted corpses, 67 recorded drops, 11,576 total, 29–249 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-torso\" title=\"Titanium Torso - in 50% of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/280b7b80b5d81046f763.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 1/2</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Flawless: 1 of 1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"shagbark-bow\" title=\"Shagbark Bow - in 50% of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6ad40ed0b4459385c272.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Shagbark Bow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 1/2</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>The Ashen Citadel</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 299</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-244\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-5737.8px,-3694.0px)\"><img src=\"tiles/5/21/13.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:5376px;top:3328px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/21/14.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:5376px;top:3584px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/22/13.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:5632px;top:3328px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/22/14.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:5632px;top:3584px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/23/13.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:5888px;top:3328px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/23/14.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:5888px;top:3584px\"><i style=\"left:5737.8px;top:3694.0px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 2028, 263 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"virikh-lord\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(2)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/lord-vorhal-the-dragonbane\"><img src=\"data/img/77a5528d6cb96f23f564.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Lord Vorhal the Dragonbane</b><span>Lv 56</span></a><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/lord-kael-the-wyrmbreaker\"><img src=\"data/img/1f6bd03b8107c4b5690b.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Lord Kael the Wyrmbreaker</b><span>Lv 59</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Skeleton: <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton\">Skeleton</a> <span class=\"muted\">(7)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms\">Skeleton Man-at-Arms</a> <span class=\"muted\">(36)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton-knight\">Skeleton Knight</a> <span class=\"muted\">(40)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/grave-knight\">Grave Knight</a> <span class=\"muted\">(44)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/knight-commander\">Knight-Commander</a> <span class=\"muted\">(47)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/virikh\">Virikh</a> <span class=\"muted\">(50)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar\">Virikh Templar</a> <span class=\"muted\">(53)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/virikh-dragonslayer\">Virikh Dragonslayer</a> <span class=\"muted\">(58)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/1f6bd03b8107c4b5690b.webp\" alt=\"Virikh Lord\"></div><h3>Virikh Lord</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>56 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 56–59)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Skeleton</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>389</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>35.3</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2800</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.1 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>2 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}